'''Putrid Holes''' are [[Point of interest#Dungeons|dungeons]] found in [[Ashlands]]. One [[Morgen]] can be found within each Putrid Hole, which does not respawn when killed. 

== Loot ==
Putrid Holes can contain large quantities of loot:
* Up to 14 [[Molten Core]]s with a 25% chance each (3.5 core on average).
* Up to 22 [[Ancient Pot]]s with a 50% chance each.
* Up to 39 [[Asksvin Carrion]].
* A 25% chance for a [[Runestone#Vegvisir|Vegvisirs]] that reveal the first [[Mysterious Location]].
* Up to 13 Meat piles with a 50% chance each:
** 1 [[Entrails]]
